    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the dungeons, defeat enemies and mine for gold! Lots of gold!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a true <strong>miner,</strong> you have the unique opportunity to collect gold and valuable resources as you dig deeper and deeper into the dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned, the deeper you go, the harder the challenges become, and the <strong>more powerful </strong>the<strong> enemies</strong> you will face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your hero with powerful <strong>loot &amp; upgrade</strong> your equipment to get more deadly and effective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> powerful <strong>skills</strong> that will aid you in future quests and become even stronger!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/09ee632456a1244d85cc384bc3ac461a.avif?t=1745237570\" width=720 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.poster.avif?t=1745237570\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.webm?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.mp4?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/2c56a7b3885398d943f49d0bce32a7ce.avif?t=1745237570\" width=720 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/6a113baaa04a44300eb87d9ba95d6bb1.poster.avif?t=1745237570\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/6a113baaa04a44300eb87d9ba95d6bb1.webm?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/6a113baaa04a44300eb87d9ba95d6bb1.mp4?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/19ea69f485dc715c44e5179361900215.avif?t=1745237570\" width=720 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/dcb2ae957193aaaf3f088ef0f39d0d6f.poster.avif?t=1745237570\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/dcb2ae957193aaaf3f088ef0f39d0d6f.webm?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/dcb2ae957193aaaf3f088ef0f39d0d6f.mp4?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/4a999f3e3a781217b53794fbb53aea8c.avif?t=1745237570\" width=720 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/b024f154332786323cb8f94e8e52c26c.poster.avif?t=1745237570\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/b024f154332786323cb8f94e8e52c26c.webm?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/b024f154332786323cb8f94e8e52c26c.mp4?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic RPG quest, as you dig and explore your way through a rougelite 3D world filled with magic and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on mini-quests, fight off feverish enemies, and survive the rush of adrenaline as you smash through obstacles and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a museum to marvel at the epic artifacts you\u2019ve collected during your magical adventure. Customize your hero with powerful loot &amp; equipment that will aid you in future quests. Unlock powerful skills to become even stronger!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the dungeons, defeat enemies and mine for gold! Lots of gold!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a true <strong>miner,</strong> you have the unique opportunity to collect gold and valuable resources as you dig deeper and deeper into the dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned, the deeper you go, the harder the challenges become, and the <strong>more powerful </strong>the<strong> enemies</strong> you will face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your hero with powerful <strong>loot &amp; upgrade</strong> your equipment to get more deadly and effective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> powerful <strong>skills</strong> that will aid you in future quests and become even stronger!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/09ee632456a1244d85cc384bc3ac461a.avif?t=1745237570\" width=720 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.poster.avif?t=1745237570\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.webm?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/59f3012942b6678d31debd0e3ea7d707.mp4?t=1745237570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417900/extras/2c56a7b3885398d943f49d0bce32a7ce.avif?t=1745237570\